TITLE                       "Sequential Customer File for OpenVMS"
IDENT                       31-MAY-2026 OpenVMS FDL Editor

SYSTEM
    SOURCE                  OpenVMS

FILE
    ALLOCATION              10000
    BEST_TRY_CONTIGUOUS     yes
